{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53354","headline":"杂句 三 · 庞藴","name":"杂句 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余有一大衣，非是世间绢。\n衆色染不着，晶晶如素练。\n裁时不用刀，缝时不用线。\n常持不离身，有人自不见。\n三千世间遮寒暑，无情有情悉覆遍，如来持得此大衣，披了直入空王殿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}